sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pesquisador
    participant FE as Frontend (AuthContext)
    participant R as routes/auth.py
    participant UC as usecases/auth.py
    participant S as services/auth.py
    participant DB as SQLite

    U->>FE: Informa e-mail e senha
    FE->>R: POST /api/auth/login (form)
    R->>UC: uc_login()
    UC->>S: buscar_por_email ou username
    S->>DB: SELECT users
    DB-->>S: usuário
    UC->>UC: verificar_senha (bcrypt)
    UC->>UC: criar_token access (60 min) e refresh (7 dias)
    UC-->>R: TokenResponse
    R-->>FE: 200 {access_token, refresh_token}
    FE->>FE: guarda tokens no localStorage
    Note over FE,R: Cada requisição seguinte envia Authorization: Bearer
    FE->>R: GET /api/auth/me
    R->>R: get_usuario_atual decodifica o JWT
    R->>DB: reconsulta o usuário (is_active)
    R-->>FE: dados do usuário
    alt Access token expirado ao recarregar a página
        FE->>R: POST /api/auth/refresh (refresh_token)
        R-->>FE: novo access_token
    end
